        <mxCell id="n0" value="Scenario: turns 1-6 of a reproducible base-setting run (seed 2026), then the result check after turn 18. Arrivals: t1 VIP (C1), t4 Regular (C2), t7 Regular, t10 Regular, t13 Critic, t16 Regular. Menu: Salad $9.00 / 1 unit, Burger $15.00 / 1 unit, Pasta $18.00 / 2 units. The manager's choice under test is the Waiter's single task on turn 4." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;size=14;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;lineHeight=1.25;" vertex="1" parent="1">          <mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="2500" height="37" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
