        <mxCell id="n31" value="Happy Hour on for turns 2-3 (remaining duration is displayed). Happy Hour roll at the start of each active turn: every customer still waiting for a table or food recovers 15 (max 100), here c1 95 -&amp;gt; 100. If the manager postponed activation to turn 3, the order taken below would keep its full VIP price of&lt;br&gt;$13.50 - when the switch is flipped changes the bill." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;size=14;fillColor=#FFF9C4;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;lineHeight=1.25;" vertex="1" parent="1">          <mxGeometry x="40" y="781" width="1500" height="52" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
